# Frontend Environment Variables Example for Microsoft Dev Tunnels Deployment

# Live Microsoft Dev Tunnel URL pointing to your backend (Port 5000)
# Example named tunnel URL format: https://<TUNNEL_NAME>-5000.<REGION>.devtunnels.ms
# Local fallback format: http://localhost:5000
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://skin-cancer-server-5000.inc1.devtunnels.ms
